      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "a1e7d3fd4d6a06141cf7bae1b7780df63fc15fa438d1108c04d5103e345367c3",
      "text": "Montevideo, Uruguay (full day)\nUruguay is a small South American country across the Río de la Plata estuary from Buenos Aires. Despite its size, it has a dynamic, growing economy, as well as colonial towns and beautiful beaches. Early in the morning, you’ll transfer to the port of Buenos Aires for the ferry across the estuary. A guide will meet you as you disembark and drive you around the highlights of Montevideo, Uruguay’s capital. You’ll visit the Port of Montevideo, Independence Square, the city centre, the Old Town and the Metropolitan Cathedral. After the tour, you’ll have free time before the return ferry. On arrival at the port in Buenos Aires, you’ll transfer to your hotel. Ferry tickets are included.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-amanda-mw6jtvf2-93zmwk49h",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      }
    },
